{"3955270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gravity", "steam_appid": 3955270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity is a difficult but rewarding platforming game about a lost astronaut on a journey to find his spaceship and return to planet Earth. Sadly, his jetpack has lost all its fuel and the only way to guide him home is to manipulate the gravitational field around him with the one of a kind Grav-o-Ball (patent pending). Along the way, encounter friends, foes, and other out-of-this-world oddities on your journey through outer space.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 15+ handcrafted levels brimming with extraterrestrial life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through complex terrain and obstacles to find the end of each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use physics to your advantage! Pilot the player through hazardous terrain with gravity as your tool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play levels to your heart's content and race to beat your own high score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stars! These elusive prizes are hidden carefully throughout each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and watch out for the aliens! :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Controls:</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls for this game are very simple: move the Grav-o-Ball with your mouse. The affects of its gravity only extend to the boundaries of the circle, so make sure to keep the player within the Grav-o-Ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955270/extras/52cd68f21e80e7552a73bb9b9d60484e.avif?t=1764959998\" width=893 height=589 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity is a difficult but rewarding platforming game about a lost astronaut on a journey to find his spaceship and return to planet Earth. Sadly, his jetpack has lost all its fuel and the only way to guide him home is to manipulate the gravitational field around him with the one of a kind Grav-o-Ball (patent pending). Along the way, encounter friends, foes, and other out-of-this-world oddities on your journey through outer space.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 15+ handcrafted levels brimming with extraterrestrial life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through complex terrain and obstacles to find the end of each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use physics to your advantage! Pilot the player through hazardous terrain with gravity as your tool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play levels to your heart's content and race to beat your own high score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stars! These elusive prizes are hidden carefully throughout each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and watch out for the aliens! :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Controls:</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls for this game are very simple: move the Grav-o-Ball with your mouse. The affects of its gravity only extend to the boundaries of the circle, so make sure to keep the player within the Grav-o-Ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955270/extras/52cd68f21e80e7552a73bb9b9d60484e.avif?t=1764959998\" width=893 height=589 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Gravity is a platformer/obstacle game where your only tool is to use a gravitational field to guide an astronaut through space. With a custom built physics engine, pull him through each level, dodging asteroids and other harmful space objects along the way.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955270/c696cfa45e5b3d59be80779a0f9828fb3c78b178/header.jpg?t=1764959998", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955270/5a441586c7b071cdd10508989d9ddb4d7cb871ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764959998", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955270/5a441586c7b071cdd10508989d9ddb4d7cb871ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764959998", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / i5-4590 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R7 360<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The game can actually run with much less disk space (~0.2 GB), but Steam does not allow periods in the text box so the number has been rounded up.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-13700 (12-core) or AMD Ryzen 7 7700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris XE / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Ezra Aslan"], "publishers": ["Ezra Aslan"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 66, "description": "Color Alternativ